            "source_url": "https://zenodo.org/records/3997352",
            "file_format": "MATLAB v7.3 (HDF5)",
            "description": "16 normal-hearing subjects, 64-channel BioSemi EEG (downsampled to 128 Hz, 0.5 Hz high-pass), listening to one of two competing Dutch stories presented dichotically or HRTF-filtered; 20 trials (~77 min) per subject.",
            "task_type": "auditory_attention",
            "reference": "Das N, Francart T, Bertrand A (2020). Auditory Attention Detection Dataset KULeuven. Zenodo. doi:10.5281/zenodo.3997352. Biesmans W et al. (2016) IEEE TNSRE 25(5):402-412.",
            "notes": "5 s non-overlapping windows, label = attended ear (0 left, 1 right). Units uV. Trial identity leaks into short windows (see README), so don't use this label as a finetune benchmark without trial-level splits."
        },
